WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
BUILD 083. WORK CONTAINS CONTENT. Extraction must not leak it.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
FILTER. CONFIDENTIALITY. SOURCE. RIGHTS. Admit, generalize, hold, or escalate.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
CANDIDATES. INSIGHT. METHOD. VISUAL. TEACHING. Only safe sources travel forward.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
APPROVAL. EVIDENCE. CONTEXT. REVIEW STATE. Keep publication human-controlled.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
BOUNDARY. SAFE CANDIDATE ≠ PUBLISHED PROOF. Fictional work only.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
SAVE. MAKE PROOF SAFELY. Retain source, rights, limits, review.
